{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1481205-lower-depths-watchtower-and-dur-abzu","id":1481205,"title":"Lower Depths Watchtower and Dur-Abzu?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-15T17:42:09-07:00","id":1481205,"title":"Lower Depths Watchtower and Dur-Abzu?","content":"So. The Supernal is Truth,and the Abyss is the Lie. And the Lower Detphs are described on page 244 of the 2e corebook as &quot;The Lower Depths are to the Fallen World what the Fallen is to the Supernal, and are therefore a Lie of the Lie&quot;<br /> Does that Super Lie has reflections of the watchtowerss like the Lie does?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-15T18:13:09-07:00","id":1481206,"title":"","content":"The Seventh Watchtower that the Tremere swear themselves to is the closest thing to such IIRC, but it's specifically mentioned that the Tremere state is impossible to achieve solely through the graces of the Lower Depths alone. Makes sense; the Lower Depths are worlds stretched thin, and I'd say there's not much substance there to formulate anything as concrete as the Watchtowers.<br /> <br /> Of course, nothing stops you from homebrewing something up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":12619,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","user":"21C Hermit","date":".  their there 05-15-2022, 09:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-15T18:52:21-07:00","id":1481208,"title":"","content":"The Abyss isn't the Lie so much as a significant component of it \u2014 it dilutes and negates the Supernal Truth such that Sleepers can only perceive the Lie that is their experience of the Fallen World. The Dur-Abzu are Abyssal experiences built out of symbolism that specifically undermines that of the Watchtowers as a narrower expression of the Abyss's nature as something that destroys meaning; they're the Abyssal subtraction to the Supernal's addition.<br /> <br /> Continuing the mathematical analogy, the Lower Depths are various flavors of zero-or-close-enough; the <i>Fallen World</i> is where Watchtower-equivalents for <i>the Lower Depths</i> would ostensibly be found, if one were to codify demonology such that this was a practical outcome, but for the moment the closest thing is the Testament system described in World of Darkness: Inferno and/or the mechanics for fiends using images of themselves to manifest out of Duat in Mummy 2e.<br /> <br /> There's lots of stuff in the Depths that can achieve weird outcomes through consuming some aspect of a human Pattern, and the ways it can corrupt phenomena into methods of feeding can get pretty esoteric (see vampires for many examples), but an equivalent to the Watchtowers would be something on the scale of a Maeljin if not greater.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-16T03:48:26-07:00","id":1481223,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1481205-lower-depths-watchtower-and-dur-abzu?p=1481208#post1481208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Abyss isn't the Lie so much as a significant component of it \u2014 it dilutes and negates the Supernal Truth such that Sleepers can only perceive the Lie that is their experience of the Fallen World. The Dur-Abzu are Abyssal experiences built out of symbolism that specifically undermines that of the Watchtowers as a narrower expression of the Abyss's nature as something that destroys meaning; they're the Abyssal subtraction to the Supernal's addition.<br /> <br /> Continuing the mathematical analogy, the Lower Depths are various flavors of zero-or-close-enough; the <i>Fallen World</i> is where Watchtower-equivalents for <i>the Lower Depths</i> would ostensibly be found, if one were to codify demonology such that this was a practical outcome, but for the moment the closest thing is the Testament system described in World of Darkness: Inferno and/or the mechanics for fiends using images of themselves to manifest out of Duat in Mummy 2e.<br /> <br /> There's lots of stuff in the Depths that can achieve weird outcomes through consuming some aspect of a human Pattern, and the ways it can corrupt phenomena into methods of feeding can get pretty esoteric (see vampires for many examples), but an equivalent to the Watchtowers would be something on the scale of a Maeljin if not greater.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, that's very interesting","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-16T03:48:58-07:00","id":1481224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1481205-lower-depths-watchtower-and-dur-abzu?p=1481206#post1481206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Seventh Watchtower that the Tremere swear themselves to is the closest thing to such IIRC, but it's specifically mentioned that the Tremere state is impossible to achieve solely through the graces of the Lower Depths alone. Makes sense; the Lower Depths are worlds stretched thin, and I'd say there's not much substance there to formulate anything as concrete as the Watchtowers.<br /> <br /> Of course, nothing stops you from homebrewing something up.</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel very tempted too","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-16T10:00:25-07:00","id":1481244,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Turgor, the Colorless Void</span></span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Ruling Arcana:</b> Forces and Spirit</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Inferior Arcana:</b> Prime </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Quote:</b> <i>&quot;Life\u2019s but a walking Shadow, a poor player that struts and frets his hour upon the stage, and then is heard no more. It is a tale </i></span></span><i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">told by an idiot, full of sound and fury, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">signifying nothing.&quot;</span></span></i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">One does not Join or Sign this Watchtower, but rather Fall into it. A mage condemned to its depths perceives the Arcana as color, emotion, raw power that can be used to give life to an otherwise gray world.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The void is constantly trying to pull you down, to consume the color stored within so it can devour the significance of your soul. That is why Prime is so rare there, all purpose and meaning is constantly being pulled down into oblivion.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Those that harness emotions survive, they are the basis that focuses will and allows one to actualize the power to climb. Master the secrets of Spirit and paint your path forward.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The weak will not be able to retain color and shall soon succumb. Wield unassailable Forces to defend yourself from those that would claim what resources you have.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Mage Sight only shows how everything is devoid of purpose and meaning, how existence is constantly and unknowingly falling to the depths of the void, towards an absolute end. It is survival instinct highlighting what can be used to persevere. Increasing one's Gnosis represents how far one has climbed back to the surface, the Supernal, the true reality where one is safe and free.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Observation:</b> This is inspired by the game <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XzS6RwXC-eI&amp;t=186s\" target=\"_blank\">The Void</a>, with the Brothers being the Manifest summons of Forces and the Sisters being the Recondite ones for Spirit.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 05-16-2022, 01:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-16T10:10:44-07:00","id":1481246,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1481205-lower-depths-watchtower-and-dur-abzu?p=1481244#post1481244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Turgor, 