ge Sight only shows how everything is devoid of purpose and meaning, how existence is constantly and unknowingly falling to the depths of the void, towards an absolute end. It is survival instinct highlighting what can be used to survive. Increasing one's Gnosis represents how far one has climbed back to the surface, the Supernal, the true reality where one is safe and free.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Observation:</b> This is inspired by the game <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XzS6RwXC-eI&amp;t=186s&amp;quot;]The</a> Void[/URL], with the Brothers being the Manifest summons of Forces and the Sisters being the Recondite ones for Spirit.</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>That's super great,exactly what I had in mind!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-18T04:38:49-07:00","id":1481359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1481205-lower-depths-watchtower-and-dur-abzu?p=1481244#post1481244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"